title: Each config folder is a Git repo whose submodules are its skgrepos in place, pinned only by the push script, and the team's running state lives in the code repo at tools/team-processing/.
pid: 0ec29b03-11a8-49e2-aed4-23d27dd6777d
body: |2-
  Built 2026-11-16 for Top's mission "Make the configs a Git repo with a
  submodule per skgrepo, and move the pacer's files, the spending account
  and the ports into the codebase" (8b1f1241), at Jeff's asking. The
  scripts are 'tools/team/make-config-repo.sh' and
  'tools/team/push-graphs-to-github.sh'; their headers say how to use and
  clone them. What follows is what they cannot say about themselves.
contains:
- 4ecf43c1-1d75-4c29-94ea-93652573f241
- 9cf082ba-010a-4734-a5e4-5a234eeda9ad
- 2267effa-ba10-4e18-a1e2-f17bf47c561e
- aa868ee8-428c-4dcd-866b-b76315a7b609
- 3eac63ea-0490-4a75-b88b-69d1165ae49a
